<Description>
<![CDATA[Steam P(Sat) Given T]]>
</Description>
<RevisionNote>
<![CDATA[Modified Instruction Help]]>
</RevisionNote>
<AdditionalHelpText>
<![CDATA[Copyright © Rockwell Automation, Inc.  All Rights Reserved.

This instruction calculates the Absolute Pressure (in MPa or PSIA)
of Saturated Steam given the Temperature (in Degrees C or F).

This instruction also reports the Enthalpy, Entropy and Specific
Volume (1/density) for liquid and (saturated) vapor at the given
Temperature.

Saturation curve and properties are calculated to IAPWS-IF97
as closely as possible using single-precision math.

The allowable input Temperature range is from 0.0 to 373.946 C
or 32.0 to 705.1028 F.
]]>
</AdditionalHelpText>
</EncodedData>
</AddOnInstructionDefinitions>
</Controller>
</RSLogix5000Content>
